    "title": "Hardee\u2019s\u00ae",
    "description": "Meet the new star of your home screen!\r\nWith the ability to order ahead for takeout, drive thru, or delivery, the Hardee\u2019s App makes \r\nmobile ordering quicky and easy. Plus, with every purchase you\u2019ll earn Stars through My \r\nRewards to redeem on your favorite items!\r\n\r\nORDERING\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking to start your day right with one of our warm, fluffy, Made from Scratch\u2122 \r\nBiscuits or craving the double-dippable juiciness of our Hand-Breaded Chicken Tenders, we\u2019ll \r\nserve you a meal made with heart.\r\nThe Hardee\u2019s App lets you customize your order and check out quickly and seamlessly with a \r\ncredit card or gift card. Schedule a pick-up time and we\u2019ll ensure your meal is hot, fresh and \r\nready when you arrive!\r\n\r\nMY REWARDS\r\nGet rewarded with every bite! Earn 10 Stars for every $1 spent and cash \u2018em in for your hand-\r\ncrafted favorites! Here are just a few of our options sure to deliver some delight to your day:\r\n\r\n150 Stars: Hand-Breaded Tender Wrap or Any Size Fountain Drink\r\n\r\n300 Stars: Frisco Breakfast Sandwich or Any Size French Fries\r\n\r\n500 Stars: Famous Star or Hand-Breaded Chicken Sandwich\r\n\r\nMy Rewards members also receive exclusive access to special discounts and promotions in the \r\nApp! New Members may even discover a little something extra waiting for them when they join\r\n\u2014let\u2019s just say it\u2019s kind of a big deal! (See what we did there?)",
